//many parts of the Earth have gotten colder//  
You are saying that global warming entails cooling as well but my definition contradicts your unproven claim thus I win this point.  
  
//You have no evidence to support that Global warming is anything else but man made.//  
It is your burden to prove that it isn't. You made the original claim. I have proven that warming is a myth even and this has gone uncontested. Since you have not disproven that fact I win.  
  
//You tell me what the climate shift is being caused by.//  
It is not happening. See my evidence from round 1.  
  
// There is no doubt the Polar bears are going extinct.//  
No doubt? I'm sorry sir but this is a debate that requires evidence, not just baseless claims. You have not proven anything.  
  
As you said regarding mercury, it has small atmosphere that does not keep a lot of heat in. But again this is invalid. This has no bearing on the debate.  
  
//So there is no doubt that a planet with a dense atmosphere is going to warm up.//  
I agree but you have not proven that our atmosphere is getting denser thus this claim does not matter. If you had proven that our atmosphere was getting denser then this would have been more interesting.  
  
//And, you also did not address my point about the climate shift happening within this century. That it started to change when the world started emitting Co2.//  
You only talked about us giving off more CO2 but you provided no evidence that it was not being recycled and you provided nothing to show that our atmosphere was getting thicker. There was no need to respond to a claim not grounded in fact.  
  
//Just Google 'temperature of the earth', and you will find an array of charts that clearly show the planet warming.//  
Just Google "reasons why gloabl warming is a myth" and you will find tons of evidence disproving your point.  
  http://stephenschneider.stanford.edu...  
  
Conclusion: My opponent never responded to my first piece of evidence (and might I add the only piece in this entire debate) which showed that warming is a myth. Since this has gone not only unrefuted but uncontested throughout the entire debate I must ask for a Con ballot.
